&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;5+ years of experience in Solutions Engineering, Sales Engineering, Solution Consulting, or Solutions Architecture supporting enterprise software.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deep domain expertise in enterprise payments gained through experience with a Payment Service Provider (PSP), payment gateway, payment orchestration platform, payment processor, or related payments technology company.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong understanding of payment ecosystems, including PSPs, gateways, acquirers, processors, card networks, payment rails, embedded payments, digital wallets, and alternative payment methods at global scale.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience designing and discussing complex payment architectures for enterprise high volume B2C / B2SMB customers.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Knowledge of payment optimization strategies, including intelligent routing, authorization optimization, tokenization, payment recovery, and payment resilience.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with REST APIs, webhooks, and modern integration patterns.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Outstanding presentation, communication, and customer-facing consulting skills.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to translate complex technical concepts into clear business value for executive audiences.&lt;/li&gt;
