&lt;li&gt;Knowledge of subscription business models and recurring billing.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience integrating payments with billing, ERP, CRM, or commerce platforms.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with PCI DSS, PSD2/SCA, and global payment regulations.&lt;/li&gt;
