&lt;p&gt;You’ll work closely with our existing customers as a trusted advisor, further pioneering business transformation while expanding Zuora’s footprint and value. You will be the CEO, aka “ZEO,” of your franchise and career – owning and driving the strategy, and leading the sales cycle with a cross-functional team, including our award‑winning customer service team. You’ll be challenged and supported as a salesperson to grow, surrounded by some of the brightest and most visionary people both in and outside of Zuora.&lt;/p&gt;
