&lt;p&gt;Modern businesses rely on a complex ecosystem of systems — CRM, ERP, billing, payments, analytics, and more. As companies adopt subscription and usage-based models, seamless data flow between these systems becomes essential.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The Integration Hub team is responsible for enabling:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Pre-built and extensible connectors to third-party systems&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Event streaming and webhook frameworks&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Scalable APIs and integration services&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Secure, reliable, and observable data exchange across platforms&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
