&lt;li&gt;Exhibit strong executive presence and ability to interact and effectively communicate with key project sponsors from CXO to end users.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deliver Expert Services to the Zuora Partners&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
